## Model card

- **Name:** Exo Free (`exo-free`)
- **Short description:** A free stealth chat model briefly served by OpenCode Zen in October 2026 and then deprecated; no vendor was ever attributed and no model card was published.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/exo-free` (catalog id `exo-free`); **deprecated** — OpenCode issue #54065 (2026-10-09) reports `"Model exo-free has been deprecated."` while the catalog still listed it.
- **Release / knowledge:** first observed in models.dev (opencode) on 2026-10-06 22:54 UTC; deprecated by 2026-10-09; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `opencode/exo-free`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens (models.dev sweep record).
- **Modalities:** text in / text out (no modality rows published).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-12):** $0 / $0 per 1M (models.dev listing); free-tier data-use terms unknown.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed stealth weights; no attribution, parameter count or licence published.

